   "ar": "",
   "tr": "allahu la ilaha illa huwa l-hayyu l-qayyum…",
   "en": "Allah: there is no god but Him, the Ever-Living, the Sustainer of all. Neither drowsiness nor sleep overtakes Him. To Him belongs all that is in the heavens and the earth… His Throne extends over the heavens and the earth, and guarding them does not tire Him. He is the Most High, the Most Great.",
